# A program declares `TaskStatus` with a payload, the name of core.service's
# workflow status. The workflow calls still return Core's TaskStatus, and the
# program's own enum keeps its payload, on every tier.
fixture: AProgramTaskStatusLeavesWorkflowsReadingCores.fixture
